}cen] `nhoui] ne ouiacpic te.<BR>
}mah `cnou] oucapviroc te.<BR>
}mah som] ou,arkydwn te.

}mah ``ftou ou`cmaragdoc te.<BR>
}mah `tiou oucardonix te.<BR>
}mah coou oucardinon te.

}mah sasfi ou`,rucoli;oc te.<BR>
}mah `smyin ouburilloc te.<BR>
}mah 'i] outopadion te.

}mah my] ouhu`akun;inon te.<BR>
}mah my] oui ou`,rucoparacoc te.<BR>
}mah my] `cnou] ou`ame;ictoc te.
